---
title: Italian Meatloaf (CSO)
description: A reliable meatloaf recipe - like this one - is an essential part of many home cooks' repertoires.
course: main dish
difficulty: easy
cook time: 45 minutes
prep time: 10 minutes
servings: 4
source.author: Sub-Zero Wolf, Mastering the CSO
source.url: https://www.subzero-wolf.com/
tags: CSO, steam
---

> Prepare fresh breadcrumbs by processing 2 or 3 fresh rolls or buns in a food processor.
> Process until loose crumbs form, and no large pieces remain. Instead of dicing, you can
> also pulse carrots and onions in the food processor.

> While baking, place the solid baking pan below the perforated pan.
> This configuration will allow excess fat to drain off the meatloaf.
> Line the solid pan with several sheets of parchment paper to reduce splatters, ease cleanup, and prevent burning. 

In a #large bowl{}, combine all ingredients, and mix thoroughly by hand.
@ground beef{1%lb}, @Italian sausage{1/2%lb}(ground or diced), @bread crumbs{2%cups},
@egg{1}(beaten), @ketchup{1/4%cup}, @onion{1/4%cup}(finely diced), @carrot{1/4%cup}(finely diced),
@Worcestershire sauce{2%tsp}, @black pepper{1/4%tsp}, @garlic powder{1/2%tsp}, @kosher salt{1/2%tsp}.

Grease the #perforated steam pan{}.
Form the mixture into two oval loaves and place onto the perforated pan.

Position the modular rack in the middle position of the #Convection Steam Oven{} (CSO).
Place the solid pan in the lower position of the modular rack.
Place the perforated pan with the meatloaves onto the top of the modular rack.

Insert the temperature probe into the center of one loaf, taking care to fully cover the metal shaft.
Insert the opposite end into the oven receptacle.

Set the oven to 345°F on Convection Humid mode.
Set the probe alert temperature to 170°F.

Bake until the alert temperature is reached, about ~{45%min}.

> If desired, when the temperature probe reaches approximately 150°F, 
> brush additional ketchup on top of meatloaves.

Remove the perforated pan from the oven and place on a cooling rack.
Using a spatula, remove the meatloaves from the pan.
Slice and serve.
